<title>UK: Aero International wins $75 mln Uzbekistan order.</title>
<headline>Aero International wins $75 mln Uzbekistan order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>European aircraft manufacturer Aero International (Regional) said on Monday that Uzbekistan Airways has ordered three British Aerospace RJ85 regional passenger jets.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the order is valued at $75 million and brings the number of RJ orders to 108, for 13 customers with 77 having been delivered.</p>
<p>Aero International (Regional) is responsible for sales and marketing of aircraft of its joint owners, Aerospatiale, British Aerospace Plc and Italy's Alenia.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
